{
  "id": "lightplayer/desktop",
  "target": "desktop",
  "vendor": "lightplayer",
  "product": "Desktop",
  "description": "The desktop board profile: a computer running the desktop firmware, which has no pins at all. The table is therefore VIRTUAL and deliberately unlimited — no reservations, no scarcity — so a project authored for any board opens here without a hardware error. Wire labels are grouped in bands: IO0–IO47 at /gpio/0–/gpio/47 (label number = address number), D0–D13 at /gpio/100+, A01–A13 at /gpio/200+, B01–B13 at /gpio/220+. Thirty-two WS281x timing resources let every wire of the largest checked-in project run at once, and /radio/0 answers radio:local:0.",
